    "description": "# PL-10: Sign Ups Related List\n\n_Related list of this player's Sign Ups._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: Sign Up ID, Operator-Deal, Status, Sign-Up Date, Deposit Date, Payout Code, Referrer, Proof, VIP\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the Aug 18 transcript\n\n* Sourced from the prototype mock-up only.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: PL-10 (Player Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Sign Up object existing — no Asana ticket for it yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc PL-10 — Player Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OSqt7ilS1feVS7aVxAYSsBZIcTrc1J31_WnQiVucEJg/edit)\n* Dependencies: None identified yet (Sign Up object not ticketed)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Remember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Player record documentation review.\n\n",
